{"content_hash": "eb4c54d67e4074b7", "version_id": 623, "article_id": 63, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Cyberpunk 2077 game will become a live-action movie", "title_zh": "《赛博朋克2077》要拍真人电影了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60e048r02lgo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580617971627-cffa74e39d1d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8dmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY3liZXJwdW5rfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjYwNDJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jezael Melgoza on Unsplash", "author": "Jezael Melgoza", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jezar?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-on-chair-in-front-of-table-2xBb36ebevg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(88, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(126, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dbb883523716"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 184, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "A popular video game is going to become a Hollywood movie. Paramount Pictures is working on a live-action film based on Cyberpunk 2077.", "lead_zh": "一款热门电子游戏要拍成好莱坞电影了。派拉蒙影业正在制作《赛博朋克2077》的真人电影。", "preview": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action movie based on the hit game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bo", "preview_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在制作一部根据热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》改编的真人电影。该公司正与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影的制作。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 611, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/63/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 78.312, "size_bytes": 473616, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 209, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@cfc1d1f/content/data/versions/623.json", "paragraphs": ["Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action movie based on the hit game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who worked on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red, the game's developer.", "CDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was excited about Paramount as a future partner. However, details about the story, release date and cast have not been revealed yet.", "Although the game had a troubled launch in 2020, it has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. It stars Keanu Reeves as Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose mind is stored on a chip inside the main character, V.", "The game takes place in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dark version of California. Players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion, Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, came out in 2023 and sold over 15 million copies.", "Cyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series called Edgerunners. Its second season will premiere on Netflix later this month. Many video game series have been turned into films and TV shows recently."], "paragraphs_zh": ["派拉蒙影业正在制作一部根据热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》改编的真人电影。该公司正与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影的制作。", "CDPR的联合首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示，公司对派拉蒙成为未来的合作伙伴感到兴奋。不过，关于故事、上映日期和演员阵容的细节尚未公布。", "尽管这款游戏在2020年发售时问题不断，但它在全球已售出超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏中饰演约翰尼·银手，一个意识被存储在主角V体内芯片上的恐怖分子。", "游戏背景设定在夜之城，这是加利福尼亚一个黑暗版本中的虚构大都市。玩家试图揭开涉及阴暗的荒坂巨型企业的阴谋。由伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴主演的资料片《往日之影》于2023年推出，销量超过1500万份。", "《赛博朋克》已经被改编成一部热门动画剧集《边缘行者》。其第二季将于本月晚些时候在Netflix首播。近年来，许多电子游戏系列被改编成电影和电视剧。"], "body": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action movie based on the hit game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who worked on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red, the game's developer.\n\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was excited about Paramount as a future partner. However, details about the story, release date and cast have not been revealed yet.\n\nAlthough the game had a troubled launch in 2020, it has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. It stars Keanu Reeves as Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose mind is stored on a chip inside the main character, V.\n\nThe game takes place in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dark version of California. Players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion, Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, came out in 2023 and sold over 15 million copies.\n\nCyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series called Edgerunners. Its second season will premiere on Netflix later this month. Many video game series have been turned into films and TV shows recently.", "body_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在制作一部根据热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》改编的真人电影。该公司正与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影的制作。\n\nCDPR的联合首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示，公司对派拉蒙成为未来的合作伙伴感到兴奋。不过，关于故事、上映日期和演员阵容的细节尚未公布。\n\n尽管这款游戏在2020年发售时问题不断，但它在全球已售出超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏中饰演约翰尼·银手，一个意识被存储在主角V体内芯片上的恐怖分子。\n\n游戏背景设定在夜之城，这是加利福尼亚一个黑暗版本中的虚构大都市。玩家试图揭开涉及阴暗的荒坂巨型企业的阴谋。由伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴主演的资料片《往日之影》于2023年推出，销量超过1500万份。\n\n《赛博朋克》已经被改编成一部热门动画剧集《边缘行者》。其第二季将于本月晚些时候在Netflix首播。近年来，许多电子游戏系列被改编成电影和电视剧。", "text": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action movie based on the hit game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who worked on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red, the game's developer. CDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was excited about Paramount as a future partner. However, details about the story, release date and cast have not been revealed yet. Although the game had a troubled launch in 2020, it has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. It stars Keanu Reeves as Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose mind is stored on a chip inside the main character, V. The game takes place in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dark version of California. Players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion, Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, came out in 2023 and sold over 15 million copies. Cyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series called Edgerunners. Its second season will premiere on Netflix later this month. Many video game series have been turned into films and TV shows recently.", "vocab": [{"word": "live-action", "pos": "adj", "zh": "真人实拍的", "note": "指由真人演员出演，而非动画", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adaptation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "改编作品", "note": "常与介词 of 连用，如 adaptation of a book", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "studio", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电影制片公司", "note": "如 Paramount Pictures 是一家 studio", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "producer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "制片人", "note": "负责电影制作和资金的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发商", "note": "这里指游戏开发公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "launch", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发行，上市", "note": "常指产品首次推出", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cast", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演员阵容", "note": "指一部电影或剧集的全体演员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "资料片，扩展包", "note": "游戏新增内容，通常需要额外购买", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "premiere", "pos": "verb", "zh": "首播，首映", "note": "指电影或剧集首次播出", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "conspiracy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "阴谋", "note": "指秘密策划的非法计划", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation", "summary_original": "The smash hit from the studio behind The Witcher series is to be turned into a film by Paramount Pictures.", "body_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation\nBy\nTom Richardson\nBBC Newsbeat\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nA live-action movie version of smash hit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being developed by Paramount Pictures.\nThe Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known for his work on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the developer of the sci-fi role-playing game.\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said in a statement\n,\nexternal\nthe company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\nDetails of the film's story, potential release date and casting information are yet to be revealed.\nDespite\na troubled launch in 2020\n, the Cyberpunk 2077 video game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.\nThe John Wick star plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of main character V.\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players work to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation.\nAn expansion, Phantom Liberty,\nstarring Idris Elba was released in 2023\nand has sold more than 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\nCyberpunk has already been successfully adapted into a popular animated series - Edgerunners - with a second season due to premiere on Netflix later this month.\nThe streamer also produced The Witcher, an adaptation of CDPR's massively popular fantasy role-playing series.\nIt originally starred former Superman actor Henry Cavill, but he was\nreplaced by Liam Hemsworth in the show's fourth season.\nMultiple video game series have been adapted for TV and film in recent years, with more due to follow.\nTwo Super Mario movies, a big screen version of Minecraft and a series of Sonic the Hedgehog films have each seen global box office takings of about $1bn.\nPlayStation game The Last of Us was made into a hit series by HBO, and Prime Video says its adaptation of post-apocalyptic role-playing series Fallout is one of its most-watched programmes.\nXbox maker Microsoft announced this week\n,\nexternal\nit had created a new \"XP\" division to focus on licensing its games for films, theme parks and other tie-ins.\nEarlier this week, Paramount Skydance completed\nits $110bn (£82.8bn) merger\nwith Warner Bros Discovery.\nIt's promised to release 30 films annually for the next two years, but also prompted\nfears over job losses and price rises for streaming services\nsuch as HBO Max and Paramount+.\nAdditional reporting by Peter Gillibrand.\nListen to Newsbeat\nlive\nat 12:45 and 17:45 weekdays - or listen back\nhere\n.\nRelated topics\nGaming", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:47:20.989997", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Paramount", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.675, "sm": 100, "em": 674, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Pictures", "s": 0.688, "e": 1.163, "sm": 687, "em": 1162, "cs": 10, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.3, "sm": 1175, "em": 1300, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "developing", "s": 1.312, "e": 1.887, "sm": 1312, "em": 1887, "cs": 22, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "a", "s": 1.9, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1900, "em": 1950, "cs": 33, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "live-action", "s": 1.962, "e": 2.65, "sm": 1962, "em": 2650, "cs": 35, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "movie", "s": 2.663, "e": 2.988, "sm": 2662, "em": 2987, "cs": 47, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "based", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.362, "sm": 3000, "em": 3362, "cs": 53, "ce": 58, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "on", "s": 3.375, "e": 3.487, "sm": 3375, "em": 3487, "cs": 59, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "the", "s": 3.5, "e": 3.562, "sm": 3500, "em": 3562, "cs": 62, "ce": 65, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "hit", "s": 3.575, "e": 3.812, "sm": 3575, "em": 3812, "cs": 66, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "game", "s": 3.825, "e": 4.112, "sm": 3825, "em": 4112, "cs": 70, "ce": 74, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "Cyberpunk", "s": 4.125, "e": 4.775, "sm": 4125, "em": 4775, "cs": 75, "ce": 84, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "2077", "s": 4.787, "e": 5.925, "sm": 4787, "em": 5925, "cs": 85, "ce": 89, "si": 0}, {"i":